VirtualFree
GetEnvironmentVariableA
lstrlenA
GetTickCount64
QueryPerformanceCounter
QueryPerformanceFrequency
GetCurrentProcessId
CreateFileA
CloseHandle
GetFileSize
ReadFile
GetFileType
GetCurrentThreadId
GetCurrentProcess
GetCurrentThread
TlsAlloc
TlsFree
TlsGetValue
TlsSetValue
IsDebuggerPresent
InitializeCriticalSection
EnterCriticalSection
LeaveCriticalSection
DeleteCriticalSection
GetModuleFileNameA
SetFilePointer
SetFilePointerEx
GetFileAttributesA
DeleteFileA
CreateDirectoryA
RemoveDirectoryA
GetCurrentDirectoryA
MultiByteToWideChar
WideCharToMultiByte
WinrunNeverHasThis
